{
  "case_goal": "Verify that an existing project can be edited successfully by toggling 'Never due' and 'Change all due dates' checkboxes and saving.",
  "summary": "Login to Collabtive, navigate to the edit form of the first project, enable 'never due' and 'change all due dates' options, then submit the edit. Confirm the project details page shows the updated budget and customer information.",
